  "created": "2026-11-12T16:42:04.443Z",
  "description": "Desktop bridges for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge app, backed by Shiny.Maui.Controls.Desktop: system tray and menu bar icons the page owns (menus, badges, notifications, animation), quick entry — a prompt window that opens over other applications from a global hotkey, with suggestions, a response area and a screen-edge glow — and the app's window, hidden to run in the tray with no taskbar or Dock entry. What the user does goes to the page. Desktop only: macOS (AppKit and Catalyst), Windows and Linux; the window bridge is not on Catalyst. bridge.AddTrayIconBridge().AddQuickEntryBridge().AddWindowBridge(o => o.HideOnClose = true).",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
